{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8a1e3fdd7ddaeb5252f4b91fc98a547dbe5e1588a1fad1f6ea6ea420c67a6a03", "ja": "追いつきたくて", "zh": "想追赶上去", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9f92461988f436038acbed79a8e610c9d2aa1f21e718dc0cb6a388feb6fa5567", "ja": "ミニライブに向け、自主練をしようとした真\nは、先に練習をしていたあずさを見つける。\n真や千早、響たちの背中を追いかけたおかげ\nで上達できたと語るあずさ。そこに千早と響\nも加わり、結局普通にレッスンすることに。", "zh": "为了迷你演唱会，真正准备自主练习时，\n发现了已经先开始练习的阿梓。\n阿梓说，多亏追随着真、千早和响她们的脚步，\n自己才能有所进步。千早和响也加入进来，最后还是一起进行了普通的课程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "247ae5adc8b45e6a7da5cf9cc612862a5defbdbf5dba16fbf5dd1c1b05af9c32", "ja": "（ふぅ、ミニライブと天体公演に向けて、残業も\n増えてきてるな……。さあ、もうひと踏ん張りだ！）", "zh": "（呼，为了迷你演唱会和天体公演，加班也越来越多了……好，再加把劲！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "0f4fe84b225543cea6dbd78a0b55416fdf57308835604c5704befcc58a2cad8f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nそろそろ、お仕事終わっちゃいますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n差不多要下班了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5cfdfd86b92ec8d91ce52da502f7239d4431fcc542e2aab56d9d29eb9437eeaf", "ja": "お、真。いや、もうちょっとかかるかな。\nもしかして、自主練か？", "zh": "哦，真。嗯，可能还要再花点时间。该不会是自主练习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "5bbc624e17c2015ab82e53e5757bd12efba2e71c804ac8e70ca7385e915af021", "ja": "はい。もうすぐミニライブもあるし、ダンスの確認も\nしておきたくて。レッスンルーム、まだいいですか？", "zh": "是的。马上就要举办迷你演唱会了，我想先确认一下舞蹈动作。练习室现在还可以用吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a1de434483db51fd6c13172b4b361a6bddda1fef636ee7d1ea76ae9bbb46b87c", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。\nむしろ、ちょうどいいと思う。", "zh": "啊，没问题。\n我反而觉得正好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "230a62f19856bdc367987aeaaf4e5bb6acd232143d47ea81f9f8df8c1aaf6df9", "ja": "1、2、3、4……！　はぁ、はぁ……。\n今のところ、もう少しテンポを上げないと……。", "zh": "1、2、3、4……！　呼、呼……。\n刚才那一段，节奏还得再快一点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1007_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "46a39c5effd8a8973a335b1aaf3a2c829ff93faa598d7cd3a9e0ce4a9eda4cec", "ja": "あれっ、あずささん！", "zh": "咦，あずさ小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "5805192e4a511ce5bf55ad9c2eaf700909b585ccc5307d14f4ef3f5c958d46d1", "ja": "まあ、真ちゃん……。\nもしかして、真ちゃんも自主練？", "zh": "哎呀，真……\n难道说，真也是来自主练习的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "79674c89ae4ae6b02a629f6e6170e49796a2fa6c7b1b6e2c4f4ee5c2f2549a39", "ja": "はい。\nあずささんも、練習してたんですね！", "zh": "是的。原来，あずさ小姐也在练习啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "c8bee9207fc02410afb8a62d17e69c13a5e4826ffe219fb8f0b032f5b59b1f83", "ja": "ええ。\n……実は、初日から居残り練習してたの。", "zh": "是的。\n……其实，我从第一天开始就留下来练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "41db0576618f6cac57c253451fa72995d2d1e3136f8ccbf713b348d08c728536", "ja": "えっ、そうだったんですか？\nでも、どうして……。", "zh": "诶，原来是这样啊？\n不过，为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "02fe2a0392c592a1984f1535663ee668539ceafcafecd4dbf92d2bd7e15000f0", "ja": "それくらいしないと、\nみんなに置いていかれちゃうから。", "zh": "不做到这种程度的话，就会被大家甩在后面了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "5f170dba0a9c2c1bac62f49358ac656c7644f532d3424a285259e93e57538174", "ja": "千早ちゃんには歌が、\n真ちゃんと響ちゃんにはダンスがあって……。", "zh": "千早有歌唱，真和响有舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "f5a9f249cf3207b22579dc0f9066a8e0861240fd674ff11333dca46ca8dbbe2f", "ja": "でも私には、これっていう得意なものがないでしょ？\nみんなに追いつくには、これくらいはしなくちゃって。", "zh": "可是我没有什么特别擅长的，对吧？\n要追上大家，就必须做到这种程度才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f64bd44f91324edbf5bfeb142d8dc3ce2c67eafd04aaf128f656c66d91b35fe", "ja": "あずささん……。", "zh": "梓小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "fe41fd2fdfc05fa5fa9f59da58df646ad471d076399224423959a0f9c165c5aa", "ja": "ついていくのは、簡単じゃないけれど……。\nやりがいはあるし、とっても楽しいわ。", "zh": "要跟上可不容易……不过很有成就感，也非常开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "3380f805a6155df4e242e8d7e58184d0581729dd5835acb7580ba0bbb5fb79e6", "ja": "……。\n得意なものがないなんて、そんなことないですよ。", "zh": "……\n才不会没有擅长的东西呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "e68f221fe3cf3022321b0be9d721095ccc1ea4b5c4eaa0ee442ab5c7d763ffe4", "ja": "ボク、あずささんのパフォーマンス、\nいつもすごいなって思ってるんです。", "zh": "我一直觉得，梓小姐的表演真的很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "58d43bb5c8b9f1bde27697d19f68872c0d69a01fb54adc8b487cbf769b7c7c12", "ja": "特に今回は、いつも以上に！　歌もカッコよくて、\nダンスも決まってて、すっごくグッとくるし！", "zh": "尤其是这次，比平时更加精彩！歌也唱得帅气，舞蹈也很到位，真的特别打动人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "43308096f5752503d3f1dc7b00e1ae14a74f327bf6c30b94296000841d2d13b4", "ja": "うふふ♪　ありがとう。でも……だとしたら、それは、\nやっぱり真ちゃん達のおかげじゃないかしら。", "zh": "呜呼呼♪谢谢。不过……如果真是这样，那果然还是多亏了真她们吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e578834dc87fe6bc7565eff2e942debed17028e29079bf7ffd587ff15f3a755", "ja": "ボク達の……？", "zh": "我们的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "fa78897e933b42d742c3a857dec7974f2524b122582d8bb56504c33610724a41", "ja": "ええ。私はみんなを目指して、みんなに追いつくために\nレッスンしているんだもの。", "zh": "嗯。我是以大家为目标，为了追上大家，一直在努力练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1024_010azu", "source_sha256": "c0c307f2fcfc698e8eacf4b7fa1d2b47bc055b0667e9eb0ce3c86319bb5269ec", "ja": "もしかしたら、765プロに入ってからずっとかもしれ\nない。……みんなの背中を見守って、追いかけて。", "zh": "也许，从加入765事务所之后，就一直是这样了吧。……守望着大家的背影，一路追赶着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "dc4edd2c71b5d2a729714503804eb8ebcec872942daa52d7614d23557277c569", "ja": "そのおかげで、私も上手になれたんだと思うわ。\n……だから、みんなのおかげ！", "zh": "多亏了大家，我觉得自己也变得更厉害了。\n……所以，都是大家的功劳！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1026_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1027_002chi", "source_sha256": "ff3d95bbd9bbb65e9aa4c76c7beb0aadad93199972c4f9c3ec3de860b8c89b2f", "ja": "あ、真、あずささん。\nふたりも自主練ですか？", "zh": "啊，真、千早小姐。\n你们两位也是来自主练习的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "8525f1aef24b55882b5f6d269f4955ac1b7a3324f297ab7dc1c797300a1a948d", "ja": "自分たちしかいないと思ってたのに。\n先を越されたぞ～。", "zh": "我还以为这里只有我们呢。没想到被你们抢先了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "10938d11a22065ffb099d436a9a1c95c1a5478c5328211385019474be1871722", "ja": "ボクも今来たところ。……なーんだ。\nつまり、みんな同じ気持ちだったみたいだね！", "zh": "我也是刚到这里。……什么嘛。\n看来，大家的心情都一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "515eb3d74560a49bf999009630b2d16aaa6db20c598539075c39b57a48079392", "ja": "そうね。みんなで居残りだと、もう自主練じゃなくて、\n普通にレッスンの延長ね♪", "zh": "是啊。大家一起留下来的话，就不算自主练习了，而是普通课程的延续呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "8c30e59b383e762914fdcc6b8c418a9794fd706a04f9f340ab1cf5c30c91590d", "ja": "よーし！　こうなったら、最初から最後まで、\n通しでやってみようか！", "zh": "好——！既然这样，就从头到尾完整地来一遍吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1032_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "d3869294d4adc417eb38a9d776c4935561676a1596c540b486b25fe8c086c13e", "ja": "1、2、3、4……！\nうん、いいね！　ここでちょっと休憩しよう！", "zh": "1、2、3、4……！\n嗯，很好！在这里稍微休息一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1034_002chi", "source_sha256": "0767f1d5bb0d1b365df98ab0a516659cb9593021c64b624b1902e6857515d0a6", "ja": "ふぅ……やっぱり、真と我那覇さんのダンスには\n敵わないわ。ふたりとも、すごかった。", "zh": "呼……果然还是比不上真和我那霸同学的舞蹈。你们两个都很厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1035_013hib", "source_sha256": "0e082a3fb22da9edd52c8dd4f7a52b009466662b682606978a63d12d150d378b", "ja": "そんなことないぞっ。\n今の千早のダンス、すごくて見とれかけちゃったし。", "zh": "没那回事啦。\n刚才千早的舞蹈特别精彩，我都差点看入迷了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "364ec57075bc0796cb0558d34ef219c8cbd830dd6107c6401b5b01ab6384db9d", "ja": "この調子だと、自分も真も\nウカウカしてられないよねっ！", "zh": "照这样下去，我和真都不能掉以轻心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "ac875228a2ab42a45c4288d7d1e4bd1fb44467640ac9a81a3f30fbb5b3fa15eb", "ja": "へへっ、ボクはウカウカなんてしないけどね。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我可不会掉以轻心哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "49dc1ce0f2020ef6c54fe53f089d356195d1d72880b87f3262f476984c9b46e0", "ja": "じ、自分だってしてないぞ！\nいつでも全力全開さー！", "zh": "我、我也没有大意哦！\n一直都是全力以赴啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "d68b380bd0ac6e266cb2131159d0803991f396f9d1eb1daebc1f3397f7645fee", "ja": "あらあら、また置いて行かれないように、\nもっともっと頑張らなくちゃ……ふふっ！", "zh": "哎呀呀，为了不再次被抛在后面，\n我可得多多努力才行了呢……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0337_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0337_story_04_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "e14d35283b797e80ce3173901adaeccf8a30d3e8a57006e634066b902a5dd5e6", "ja": "じゃあ、ひと息ついたら、もう1回やってみよう！\n今度は、さっきのパフォーマンスを超えるつもりで！", "zh": "那歇口气后，再来1次吧！  \n这次要争取超越刚才的表现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
